From 750da699e90a496d40b526979c145c907d9c59db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpenelange <191051681+mpenelange@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:35:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] netfilter, bridge, sched, macvlan: mark flows the offload engine must not cache

Same as the UEK6 er4 branch, rebased onto UEK7 U3 (5.15): per-extension
cvm_no_offload flags for xtables matches/targets and nftables
expressions, xt_conntrack/nft_ct/nft_meta conditional marks, and the
bridge/tc/macvlan marks. Compiles away without
CONFIG_CAVIUM_NET_PACKET_FWD_OFFLOAD.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
